OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aas second glitch causes more disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FAirlines have criticised the UK's air
OL,7,Ftraffic control over a second glitch
OL,8,Fthis month that has caused flight
OL,9,Fdelays and cancellations.
OL,11,FEasyJet said Monday's incident "once
OL,12,Fagain calls into question the
OL,13,Fresilience" of the system, while Wizz
OL,14,FAir said there was a "national
OL,15,Fconfidence crisis" in Nats, which runs
OL,16,Fthe UK's air traffic.
OL,18,FThe technical problem at Prestwick in
OL,19,FAyrshire caused disruption at airports
OL,20,Facross Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,21,Fnorthern England, delaying dozens of
OL,22,Fflights.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
