OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aas second glitch causes more disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FNats said a "connectivity issue" was to
OL,7,Fblame for the disruption, and that it
OL,8,Fhad "nothing to do" with a separate
OL,9,Fsoftware defect at Swanwick that led to
OL,10,Fthe cancellation of 2,000 flights
OL,11,Fearlier in September.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
